    <h3>5.1 Inclination Distribution</h3>
    <p>Orbital inclination measures the tilt of an orbit relative to Earth's equatorial plane (0&deg; = equatorial, 90&deg; = polar). The distribution reveals distinct operational clusters corresponding to specific mission profiles and constellation designs.</p>

